<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Graft-Only Vaginoplasty — Brad Figler MD FACS</title>
    <!-- Google Fonts for typography -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Merriweather:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,700;1,300&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <!-- FontAwesome for icons -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary-navy: #13294B;
            --primary-navy-dark: #0a182f;
            --carolina-blue: #4B9CD3;
            --carolina-blue-hover: #3582b5;
            --text-dark: #2c3e50;
            --text-muted: #556575;
            --bg-light: #f8fafc;
            --white: #ffffff;
            --border-color: #e2e8f0;
            --transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto;
            color: var(--text-dark);
            background-color: var(--white);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        h1, h2, h3, h4, h5, h6 {
            font-family: 'Merriweather', serif, Georgia, serif;
            color: var(--primary-navy);
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: var(--carolina-blue);
            transition: var(--transition);
        }

        a:hover {
            color: var(--primary-navy);
        }

        .container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
        }

        /* Header */
        header {
            background-color: var(--white);
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
            padding: 20px 0;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .brand-name {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--primary-navy);
            font-family: 'Merriweather', serif;
        }

        .brand-title {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-weight: 500;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            margin-top: 4px;
        }

        /* Main Content Section */
        .main-section {
            padding: 80px 0;
            background-color: var(--bg-light);
            text-align: center;
            min-height: calc(100vh - 280px);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .content-card {
            background: var(--white);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 60px 40px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.02);
            width: 100%;
        }

        .content-card h1 {
            font-size: 2.25rem;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            color: var(--primary-navy);
        }

        .content-card p {
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: 0 auto 40px auto;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        .button-group {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 20px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .btn {
            padding: 14px 28px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-weight: 600;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            font-size: 1rem;
            transition: var(--transition);
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background-color: var(--carolina-blue);
            color: var(--white);
        }

        .btn-primary:hover {
            background-color: var(--primary-navy);
            color: var(--white);
        }

        .btn-secondary {
            background-color: var(--primary-navy);
            color: var(--white);
        }

        .btn-secondary:hover {
            background-color: var(--carolina-blue);
            color: var(--white);
        }

        /* Footer */
        footer {
            background-color: var(--primary-navy-dark);
            color: #cbd5e1;
            padding: 30px 0;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Header -->
    <header>
        <div class="container">
            <div class="brand-name">Brad Figler MD FACS</div>
            <div class="brand-title">Genitourinary Reconstructive Surgery</div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Main Content Section -->
    <section class="main-section">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="content-card">
                <h1>Graft-Only Vaginoplasty</h1>
                <p>Graft only vaginoplasty is an innovative minimally invasive approach to gender affirming vaginoplasty.</p>
                
                <div class="button-group">
                    <a href="https://vimeo.com/1171609774?share=copy&fl=sv&fe=ci" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-primary">
                        <i class="fas fa-play-circle"></i> Watch Patient Education Video
                    </a>
                    <a href="mailto:bradfiglermd@gmail.com" class="btn btn-secondary">
                        <i class="fas fa-envelope"></i> Contact Us
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer>
        <div class="container">
            <p>&copy; 2026 Brad Figler MD FACS. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
